    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Light sphere, Weather sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you use control weather, you may also choose to increase the light level by one step in the same area, up to a maximum of normal light. At 10th caster level, you may increase the light level by an additional step. Areas of magical darkness in range of this effect are unaffected, their light levels remaining unchanged.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/light#toc71\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
